data: {"id": "5bb155d65451412d-thinking-parallel_evidence-198", "run_id": "5bb155d65451412d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=427 lines=8\nInvestigation plan updated with 4 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 2 completed, 1 in progress, 1 pending\n[ ] [t4] 综合当前事实判断：OOM / probe failur", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788822192874, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_38405689da4648e786ac741f", "tool_sequence": 9, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=427 lines=8\nInvestigation plan updated with 4 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 2 completed, 1 in progress, 1 pending\n[ ] [t4] 综合当前事实判断：OOM / probe failure / 证据不足\n[~] [t3] 排查 Liveness probe 返回 500 的原因：检查当前 app 日志与 tracing\n[✓] [t1] 确认 Pod 身份与当前状态（YAML/Describe 已覆盖，结论整理）\n[✓] [t2] 验证 CrashLoopBackOff 直接原因：Exit Code 137 对应 OOMKilled，需 metrics 补证\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/5bb155d65451412d-g1/tools/012-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/5bb155d65451412d-g1/tools/012-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/5bb155d65451412d-g1/tools/012-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

